    "rich_text_dzQzWT": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_xKCfd9": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<h1><br/>Mel’s Flower Truck — Delivery Information<br/><br/></h1>",
            "heading_size": "hxl"
          }
        },
        "text_MFtHmD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2><strong>Same‑Day Flower Delivery Across Auckland</strong></h2><p><strong>Need flowers delivered today?</strong>  <br/>Order <strong>before 9am</strong> for <strong>same‑day business deliveries</strong>, and <strong>before 12pm</strong> for <strong>same‑day residential delivery across Auckland</strong>.</p><p>If you place your order <strong>after 12pm</strong>, the website won’t allow you to select same‑day delivery — you’ll need to choose the next day instead.</p><p>If you <strong>desperately</strong> need flowers delivered after 12pm, get in touch.<br/>I can sometimes arrange a late delivery through <strong>Deadline Couriers</strong>, but this won’t be at the standard delivery rates.</p><p><strong>We deliver Monday–Saturday, creating seasonal, market‑fresh flower bouquets that last and bring serious WOW factor — delivered to homes, workplaces, hospitals, and events all over Auckland.</strong></p><h1>🌸 <strong>Where We Deliver (Auckland Suburbs We Cover)</strong></h1><p>We deliver across <strong>East Auckland, Central Auckland, the North Shore, South Auckland, and parts of West Auckland</strong>.</p><h3><strong>East Auckland (our home turf)</strong></h3><p>St Johns, Glen Innes, Meadowbank, Mission Bay, Kohimarama, Orakei, Remuera, Stonefields, Ellerslie, Mt Wellington, Panmure.</p><h3><strong>Central Auckland</strong></h3><p>Parnell, Newmarket, Grafton, Eden Terrace, Auckland CBD.</p><h3><strong>North Shore</strong></h3><p>Takapuna, Devonport, Belmont, Milford, Northcote.</p><h3><strong>South Auckland</strong></h3><p>Onehunga, Royal Oak, Epsom, Mt Eden, Greenlane.</p><h3><strong>West Auckland (selected suburbs)</strong></h3><p>Avondale, New Lynn, Henderson.</p><p>If your suburb isn’t showing at checkout, flick us a message — we can usually make it work.</p><h1>🌼 <strong>Delivery Pricing</strong></h1><p>Delivery ranges from <strong>$10–$18</strong>, depending on the suburb.<br/>Your exact delivery fee is calculated at checkout.</p><h3><strong>$10 Delivery — Auckland Postcode 1072 (Local Zone)</strong></h3><p>This is our local delivery area — close to the truck and easy for us to reach.<br/>$10 delivery applies to:</p><p>Stonefields</p><p>St Johns</p><p>Glen Innes</p><p>Meadowbank</p><p>Panmure</p><p>Point England</p><p>Wai O Taiki Bay</p><p>Because these suburbs are local, if you miss the <strong>12pm same‑day cut‑off</strong>, <strong>I can often still help</strong>.<br/>Just give me a call on <strong>021 234 7844</strong>.</p><h3><strong>$14 Delivery — Auckland Postcode 1071</strong></h3><p>$14 delivery applies to:</p><p>Kohimarama</p><p>Mission Bay</p><p>Orakei</p><p>Glendowie</p><p>St Heliers</p><p>These suburbs are slightly further out but still close enough for fast, reliable delivery — and again, if you miss the <strong>12pm cut‑off</strong>, <strong>I can often help</strong>.<br/>Call me on <strong>021 234 7844</strong>.</p><h1>🌸 <strong>Delivery Timeframes (How Our Couriers Work)</strong></h1><p>We deliver between <strong>9am–7pm</strong> each day. Because we use specialised floral couriers, exact delivery times can’t be guaranteed — but your flowers will always be delivered within this window.</p><p>At Mel’s Flower Truck, we use <strong>Premier Floral Couriers</strong>, a same‑day courier company that works exclusively with Auckland florists. They’re experts at transporting fresh bouquets safely, and their delivery system is designed to move large volumes of floral orders efficiently across the city.</p><h3><strong>Two Delivery Runs Each Day</strong></h3><p>Premier Floral Couriers operate on a <strong>two‑run system</strong>:</p><h3><strong>Morning Run</strong></h3><p>Pick‑ups from Auckland florists happen between <strong>9am–11am</strong></p><p>All orders go to a central <strong>depot</strong></p><p>Deliveries are sorted into areas: <strong>East, Central, North Shore, West, South</strong>, etc.</p><p>Couriers then work <strong>systematically through each area</strong>, delivering every order from the morning run</p><h3><strong>Afternoon Run</strong></h3><p>Pick‑ups happen again from <strong>12pm–2pm</strong></p><p>Everything arrives at the depot around <strong>2:30pm</strong></p><p>Deliveries are sorted by area again</p><p>Couriers head out and deliver all orders from the afternoon run</p><h3><strong>Why Exact Delivery Times Are Tricky</strong></h3><p>Premier Floral Couriers are <strong>not direct point‑to‑point couriers</strong>.<br/>They don’t pick up one order and drive straight to one address — they deliver <strong>every order in each area</strong> in the most efficient route.</p><p>Because of this:</p><p>Exact delivery times cannot be guaranteed</p><p>Deliveries may arrive anytime between <strong>9am–7pm</strong></p><p>Timing depends on the suburb, traffic, access, and how many florists are on each run</p><h3><strong>Business Deliveries</strong></h3><p>Business deliveries <strong>cannot be guaranteed</strong> due to reception hours, early closures, and strict delivery windows.<br/>Some business addresses may not be suitable for Premier’s route system.</p><h3><strong>Home Deliveries</strong></h3><p>Home deliveries are <strong>no problem at all</strong> — they fit perfectly within Premier’s delivery structure and are usually very smooth.</p><h1>🌼 <strong>What We Need From You</strong></h1><p>To make sure your flowers arrive smoothly, please include:</p><h3><strong>Recipient details</strong></h3><p>Full name</p><p>Full delivery address (include company name if applicable)</p><p>Contact number (essential for couriers)</p><h3><strong>Your details</strong></h3><p>Your name</p><p>Your contact number</p><p>Card message (optional but recommended)</p><p>These details help us deliver to apartments, workplaces, hospitals, and gated properties without delays.</p>"
          }
        },
